WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.393
Video 27. Help, support file, ane updates.

00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:09.704
F1 thi tame je screen par chho eni help khule
chhe.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:13.209
Manual Hisaab na darek bhaag ne samjaave chhe.

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:17.698
Koi takleef rahe, to support file save karo,
ane amne lakho.

00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:23.331
Aa Balance Sheet chhe. Koi pan screen par, F1
dabaavo.

00:00:23.361 --> 00:00:30.135
Help menu khule chhe. Fari F1 thi aa screen nu
manual page khule chhe.

00:00:30.165 --> 00:00:34.090
Aa Balance Sheet nu page chhe, report ni keys
saathe.

00:00:36.415 --> 00:00:43.566
F1, N thi aakhu manual khule chhe: Getting
Started thi Windows app sudhi.

00:00:44.646 --> 00:00:50.532
Takleef rahe tyaare: F1, Troubleshooting, Save
a Support File.

00:00:50.562 --> 00:01:01.258
Hisaab error log, versions ane settings ek zip file ma tamara
Desktop par muke chhe. Passwords ane keys ema nathi jata.

00:01:01.288 --> 00:01:11.502
Ctrl+A dabaavo, ane file Desktop par aave chhe. Hisaab jaate
kai nathi mokaltu: tame file email ma jodo chho.

00:01:12.582 --> 00:01:18.753
F1, W thi What's New dekhaay chhe: darek
version na pherphaar.

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:27.954
F1, U navu version tapaase chhe. Aa PC par
chhellu version chhe, 1.0.4.

00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:38.067
Windows app ma, navu version taiyaar hoy tyaare Hisaab ek
savaal puchhe chhe. Ema release notes dekhaay chhe.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:41.845
Yes thi pehla darek company no backup thaay
chhe.

00:01:41.775 --> 00:01:47.936
Pachhi Hisaab navu version install kare chhe, ane
tamari companies saathe fari sharu thaay chhe.

00:01:48.136 --> 00:01:53.034
Savaal chhe? info@nexertechnology.com par
lakho.

00:01:52.964 --> 00:01:55.786
Support file jodo, ane steps lakho.

